  "monotone_floor": "\\varepsilon_M^*(y)=\\frac12\\max\\{0,\\max_{i<j}(y_i-y_j)\\},\n\\qquad 1-\\frac{\\varepsilon_M^*(y)}{\\varepsilon_E^*(y)}\n\\le 1-\\frac{\\varepsilon_M^*(y)}{M}.",
