  "add_jac_null": "J=\\begin{pmatrix}a&v_0&0&0\\\\a&v_0+\\eta e&ae&0\\\\\\kappa&0&0&v_0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad J\\begin{pmatrix}v_0\\\\-a\\\\\\eta\\\\-\\kappa\\end{pmatrix}=0",
